{"slug":"sword-x-staff-where-to-use-stamina","title":"Stamina usage 101","author":"Sefhi","published":"Apr 08, 2026","updated":"May 18, 2026","html":" <!-- Author --> <p><img src=\"/img/guides/stamina-screen.webp\" alt=\"sword x staff stamina screen\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"where-to-spend-stamina\">Where to spend stamina</h2>\n<p> <span class=\"tooltip-wrapper R\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/Money_57_Tili.png\" class=\"tooltip-inline-icon SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <span class=\"tooltip-target\">Stamina</span> <span class=\"tooltip-content\"> <span class=\"tooltip-header\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/Money_57_Tili.png\" class=\"tooltip-image SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"Stamina\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <strong class=\"tooltip-name\">Stamina</strong> </span> <span class=\"tooltip-section\"> <span class=\"tooltip-label\">Description</span> <span class=\"tooltip-text\">Required for gathering on Blessed Lands and fighting monsters on the world map. Recovers 5 Stamina per hour, up to 300.</span> </span> </span> </span> in Sword x Staff is solely used to gather resources around the map, which is nice since is just extra resources for free.</p>\n<div class=\"guide-alert blue\"><div class=\"title\">Usage changes seasonally</div><p>Each season in the game will change how you use your <span class=\"tooltip-wrapper R\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/Money_57_Tili.png\" class=\"tooltip-inline-icon SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <span class=\"tooltip-target\">Stamina</span> <span class=\"tooltip-content\"> <span class=\"tooltip-header\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/Money_57_Tili.png\" class=\"tooltip-image SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"Stamina\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <strong class=\"tooltip-name\">Stamina</strong> </span> <span class=\"tooltip-section\"> <span class=\"tooltip-label\">Description</span> <span class=\"tooltip-text\">Required for gathering on Blessed Lands and fighting monsters on the world map. Recovers 5 Stamina per hour, up to 300.</span> </span> </span> </span> based on what you currently need.</p><p>Use this guide as a reference and always optimize based on your needs.</p></div>\n<p>In my opinion the best way early game to use your stamina is simply to get more <span class=\"tooltip-wrapper W\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/Money_1.png\" class=\"tooltip-inline-icon SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <span class=\"tooltip-target\">Rolla</span> <span class=\"tooltip-content\"> <span class=\"tooltip-header\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/Money_1.png\" class=\"tooltip-image SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"Rolla\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <strong class=\"tooltip-name\">Rolla</strong> </span> <span class=\"tooltip-section\"> <span class=\"tooltip-label\">Description</span> <span class=\"tooltip-text\">Use them for gear enhance, ascension, and buying items from the shop.</span> </span> <span class=\"tooltip-section\"> <span class=\"tooltip-label\">Sources</span> <span class=\"tooltip-list\"> <span>Furniture Hang-Up</span><span>Gameplay</span><span>Delegate Tasks</span> </span> </span> </span> </span> . This is used <em>EVERYWHERE</em> in the game, and early on can be a bottleneck for most players.</p>\n<p>You can use your <span class=\"tooltip-wrapper W\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/Money_1.png\" class=\"tooltip-inline-icon SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <span class=\"tooltip-target\">Rolla</span> <span class=\"tooltip-content\"> <span class=\"tooltip-header\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/Money_1.png\" class=\"tooltip-image SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"Rolla\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <strong class=\"tooltip-name\">Rolla</strong> </span> <span class=\"tooltip-section\"> <span class=\"tooltip-label\">Description</span> <span class=\"tooltip-text\">Use them for gear enhance, ascension, and buying items from the shop.</span> </span> <span class=\"tooltip-section\"> <span class=\"tooltip-label\">Sources</span> <span class=\"tooltip-list\"> <span>Furniture Hang-Up</span><span>Gameplay</span><span>Delegate Tasks</span> </span> </span> </span> </span> to purchase even more goods on your daily shop and also refresh it to fully restock up to 10 times per day.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/img/guides/where-to-spend-dawnium.webp\" alt=\"sword x staff daily shop cart\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p><strong>F2P should do at least 3 refreshes per day</strong> and buyout most (if not all) the resources on the daily shop.</p>\n<p>If you care about seasonal rankings, you can focus instead on <span class=\"tooltip-wrapper W\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/item_41300.png\" class=\"tooltip-inline-icon SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <span class=\"tooltip-target\">Raw Ore</span> <span class=\"tooltip-content\"> <span class=\"tooltip-header\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/item_41300.png\" class=\"tooltip-image SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"Raw Ore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <strong class=\"tooltip-name\">Raw Ore</strong> </span> <span class=\"tooltip-section\"> <span class=\"tooltip-label\">Description</span> <span class=\"tooltip-text\">Use them for gear enhancement.</span> </span> <span class=\"tooltip-section\"> <span class=\"tooltip-label\">Sources</span> <span class=\"tooltip-list\"> <span>Fantasy Ladder</span><span>Gameplay</span><span>Delegate Tasks</span> </span> </span> </span> </span> and <span class=\"tooltip-wrapper W\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/item_41400.png\" class=\"tooltip-inline-icon SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <span class=\"tooltip-target\">Chrono Sand</span> <span class=\"tooltip-content\"> <span class=\"tooltip-header\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/item_41400.png\" class=\"tooltip-image SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"Chrono Sand\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <strong class=\"tooltip-name\">Chrono Sand</strong> </span> <span class=\"tooltip-section\"> <span class=\"tooltip-label\">Description</span> <span class=\"tooltip-text\">Use it to enhance Relics.</span> </span> <span class=\"tooltip-section\"> <span class=\"tooltip-label\">Sources</span> <span class=\"tooltip-list\"> <span>Furniture Hang-Up</span><span>Gameplay</span><span>Delegate Tasks</span> </span> </span> </span> </span> .</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"resource-nodes\">Resource nodes</h2>\n<p>When you are farming resources, you can spot bigger nodes that yield higher amount of resources.</p>\n<div class=\"text-tabs\"> <div class=\"tabs\"> <button class=\"tab-button active\" data-tab=\"text-tab-0\"> Big nodes </button><button class=\"tab-button\" data-tab=\"text-tab-1\"> Special nodes </button> </div> <div class=\"text-content\"> <div id=\"text-tab-0\" class=\"tab-content active\"> <div><p><img src=\"/img/guides/big-nodes.webp\" alt=\"sword x staff resource big nodes\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>You can share them in chat with other players (or your guild) so they can farm resources with you, with a weekly cap.</p></div> </div> <div id=\"text-tab-1\" class=\"tab-content\"> <div><p><img src=\"/img/guides/special-nodes.webp\" alt=\"sword x staff resource special nodes\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>Outside the main resources, you can also farm for special nodes that will provide gems and cooking materials.</p><p>Not sure on the daily limit for these ones, but you can sell them in the auction house for <span class=\"tooltip-wrapper SR\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/Money_2.png\" class=\"tooltip-inline-icon SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <span class=\"tooltip-target\">Dawnium</span> <span class=\"tooltip-content\"> <span class=\"tooltip-header\"> <img src=\"/img/tooltips/Money_2.png\" class=\"tooltip-image SWORDXSTAFF item\" alt=\"Dawnium\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <strong class=\"tooltip-name\">Dawnium</strong> </span> <span class=\"tooltip-section\"> <span class=\"tooltip-label\">Description</span> <span class=\"tooltip-text\">A currency for shop purchases, obtainable through exchanging Luminium at a 1:1 ratio.</span> </span> </span> </span> which is pretty nice.</p></div> </div> <div id=\"text-tab-2\" class=\"tab-content\"> </div> <div id=\"text-tab-3\" class=\"tab-content\"> </div> <div id=\"text-tab-4\" class=\"tab-content\"> </div> <div id=\"text-tab-5\" class=\"tab-content\"> </div> <div id=\"text-tab-6\" class=\"tab-content\"> </div> <div id=\"text-tab-7\" class=\"tab-content\"> </div> <div id=\"text-tab-8\" class=\"tab-content\"> </div> <!-- Repeat for more tabs if necessary --> </div> </div> <hr>\n<h2 id=\"setting-up-auto\">Setting up auto</h2>\n<p>The first time you manually click on a node to farm, you can just click on the auto button that will appear on top of chat.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/img/guides/auto-farm.webp\" alt=\"sword x staff resource auto farm\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>This will allow you to select how much stamina you want to spend on that specific resource and your character will automatically pick them up.</p> "}